msgctxt "Alert to user when opening browser developer console"
msgid "Stop!"
msgstr "Stani!"

msgid ""
"This is a browser feature intended for developers. If someone told you to "
"copy-paste something here, they are likely trying to compromise your Weblate "
"account."
msgstr ""
"Ova je funkcija preglednika namijenjena programerima. Ako ti je netko rekao "
"da ovdje nešto kopiraš i zalijepiš, onda ta osoba vjerojatno pokušava "
"hakirati tvoj web-račun."

msgid "See https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Self-XSS for more information."
msgstr "Pogledaj https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Self-XSS za više informacija."

